{"id": "board-of-appeals-real-estate-income-disclosures", "title": "An appeals commissioner reported brokerage income but omitted its sources", "seconds": 44.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "dd1f668579553822", "words": 126, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An appeals commissioner disclosed his brokerage income every year.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.36, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Behind", "the", "brokerage", "total"], "sub": "The disclosure threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 1.01, 1.54, 1.69, 2.2, 2.58, 2.86]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The filings covered 2017 through 2020.", "t0": 3.48, "t1": 5.94, "shot": "s0-more1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The filings covered 2017 through 2020"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.56, 0.85, 1.13, 1.62, 1.85, 2.11]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Each statement reported more than $100,000 from the brokerage.", "t0": 6.06, "t1": 9.58, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Each statement reported more than $100,000 from the brokerage"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.68, 1.14, 1.28, 1.46, 1.64, 1.95, 2.36, 2.66, 2.81, 2.91]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The rules also required him to name individual sources.", "t0": 9.7, "t1": 12.46, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "The disclosure threshold", "text": "commission income", "mark": "commission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.77, 1.2, 1.32, 1.44, 1.67, 2.17]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The threshold was $10,000 from a source.", "t0": 12.58, "t1": 15.01, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The threshold was $10,000 from a source"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.66, 0.83, 1.06, 1.39, 1.68, 1.86, 1.94]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Investigators identified 37 omitted sources.", "t0": 15.23, "t1": 18.01, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Investigators identified 37 omitted sources"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.69, 1.2, 1.83, 2.2]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The aggregate reported on each form left those sources unnamed.", "t0": 18.13, "t1": 22.18, "shot": "s4-more1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The aggregate reported on each form left those sources unnamed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.68, 1.16, 1.27, 1.51, 2.25, 2.5, 2.73, 3.2]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Darryl Honda filed amended forms.", "t0": 22.3, "t1": 24.15, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Darryl Honda filed amended forms"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.72, 1.05, 1.38]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Investigators checked the names against matters before the Board of Appeals.", "t0": 24.27, "t1": 28.09, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Investigators checked the names against matters before the Board of Appeals"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.72, 1.05, 1.16, 1.44, 1.78, 2.17, 2.55, 2.66, 2.92, 3.02]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "They found no evidence any had pending business there during those periods.", "t0": 28.21, "t1": 31.93, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The docket check"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.57, 0.76, 1.18, 1.5, 1.68, 2.03, 2.4, 2.65, 2.89, 3.1]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Commission assessed $22,200.", "t0": 32.15, "t1": 34.9, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$22,200", "label": "The assessment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.53, 0.92, 1.41, 1.8, 1.97, 2.23]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "It set the penalty at $600 per source.", "t0": 35.02, "t1": 37.71, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "It set the penalty at $600 per source"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.42, 0.52, 0.88, 1.01, 1.23, 1.46, 1.79, 1.96]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The order credits Honda for cooperating with the investigation.", "t0": 37.83, "t1": 40.8, "shot": "s9-more1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The order credits Honda for cooperating with the investigation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.43, 0.78, 1.16, 1.32, 1.92, 2.04, 2.15]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.92, "t1": 43.29, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The disclosure threshold", "b": "The docket check", "o": "The assessment"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "number"}